{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "在 Scanpy 1.11.2 中，sc.pp.pca 确实暴露了 zero_center 参数，因此你传入 zero_center=false 会被函数接收。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "zero_center\n        If `True`, compute (or approximate) PCA from covariance matrix.\n        If `False`, performa a truncated SVD instead of PCA."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "在 Scanpy 1.11.2 中，sc.pp.pca 也暴露了 chunked 参数，因此你传入 chunked=false 会被函数接收。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "chunked\n        If `True`, perform an incremental PCA on segments of `chunk_size`.\n        Automatically zero centers and ignores settings of `zero_center`, `random_seed` and `svd_solver`.\n        If `False`, perform a full PCA/truncated SVD (see `svd_solver` and `zero_center`).\n        See table above for which solver class is used."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "当 chunked=false 时，文档说明会执行完整 PCA 或截断 SVD，具体取决于 svd_solver 和 zero_center。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "If `False`, perform a full PCA/truncated SVD (see `svd_solver` and `zero_center`)."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "zero_center=false 的文档语义是执行截断 SVD 而不是 PCA。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "If `False`, performa a truncated SVD instead of PCA."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：仅凭 zero_center=false 不能单独确定完整分支；截断 SVD 分支需要同时满足 chunked=false 且 zero_center=false，这是可检测性局限，不代表你的参数不会生效。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "zero_center\n        If `True`, compute (or approximate) PCA from covariance matrix.\n        If `False`, performa a truncated SVD instead of PCA."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的输入是 500 个细胞 × 100 个基因的观测×变量矩阵，符合 data 参数的行列对应关系。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:matrix"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的 chunked=false 与 zero_center=false 组合，在文档语义上指向截断 SVD 分支。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:chunked",
        "user:zero_center"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
